spike william pratt bloody~
Spike~
Spike broods in the shadows.
~
   Formerly known as William the Bloody, this tall being now goes by the name
Spike, taken from his preferred method of killing.  He stands before you with a
stern look upon his face wearing a dark, black leather duster.  Stolen as a
trophy from his most prized kill, it flows to his knees concealing him within
the shadows.  His appearance suggests a young man, but his grace and fluid like
movements prove otherwise.  While young in terms of a vampire at only a century
old, his knowledge and skill is invaluable.  With pure white hair and piercing
black eyes you could almost say his appearance is angelic, until he sinks his
fangs into your neck that is...
~
